  "prefLabel": "Rev 2505.02 Form DP-175, Electronic Funds Transfer ACH Credit Registration for Business Tax Payments",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Rev 2505.02 Form DP-175, Electronic Funds Transfer ACH Credit Registration for Business Tax Payments.\n\n(a) Business tax taxpayers shall complete and file with the department, Form DP-175, “Electronic Funds Transfer ACH Credit Registration for Business Tax Payments”, to register to remit payments by ACH credit.\n\n(b) Form DP-175, “Electronic Funds Transfer ACH Credit Registration for Business Tax Payments” shall be filed at least 30 days prior to:\n\n(1) The first ACH credit payment; or\n\n(2) Any changes in the information.\n\nSource. #8495, eff 11-30-05; ss by #10484, eff 12-5-13; ss by #13724, eff 8-18-23 (see Revision Note at chapter heading for Rev 2500)\n\nAPPENDIX",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/rev2500.html"
